## Data Models

### Core Models
- **User** — name, email, role (`EDUCATOR | STUDENT | ADMIN | REGISTRAR`), department, college, bio, personalContext, totalXP, title; onboarding fields (`onboardingCompleted`, `enrichmentSource`, `enrichmentConfidence`, `onboardingIntent`); presence fields (`lastSeenAt`, `lastPath`); SIS fields (`sisStudentId`, `program`, `catalogYear`)
- **Tool** — the primary content unit. Types: `EXTERNAL | CHATBOT | SIMULATION | QUIZ | AI_INTERVIEW | DEBATE | STUDY_BUDDY`. Has system prompt, learning objectives, category, difficulty, audience, `approvalStatus` (COMMUNITY/PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED/SUSPENDED)
  - `isOfficialService` (Boolean) — marks tools deployed as official university service bots
  - `serviceProtocol` (String?) — `'informational' | 'regulatory' | 'transactional'`
  - `escalationEmail` (String?) — contact email injected into service bot system prompts
  - `webhookSecret` (String) — for external integrations
  - Audio fields: `audioEnabled`, `audioPersonaName`, `audioEngine`, `audioVoiceName`, `audioSpeakingStyle`, `audioSpeed`, `audioSystemSuffix`, `audioBackgroundTrack`
  - Collab fields: `collabEnabled`, `collabModes`, `collabMaxUsers`
- **ToolSession** — one session = one student using one tool. Tracks start/end time, message count, `audioSessionDurationSecs`, `audioActivated`; AI-generated `summary` field (Covered / Strong / Review wrap-up)
- **MetricEvent** — custom events fired during tool use (e.g. "correct_answer", "rubric_score")
- **CustomMetricDefinition** — per-tool metric schemas defined by the educator
- **Upvote / Favorite / Comment** — social engagement on tools
- **Bounty** — a request posted by an educator for a tool to be built. Status: OPEN → CLAIMED → FULFILLED
- **BountyReview** — review attached to a fulfilled bounty
- **Course** — a course with materials organized in module folders
- **CourseMaterial** — uploaded content (text/markdown) with moduleNumber for folder grouping
- **LibraryEntry** — a student's saved tool (userId + toolId, unique)
- **Assignment** — a task for students (linked to a Tool or a file upload)
- **CollabRequest** — a request to collaborate on / improve an existing tool
- **CollabReview** — an AI-guided review session attached to a CollabRequest
- **BuildSession** — a builder chat session (links to ToolDocuments)
- **ToolDocument** — uploaded reference docs attached to a tool or build session
- **XPEvent / UserBadge / Quest / UserQuest** — gamification layer
- **SandTransaction** — tracks Sand currency deltas (earned from bounties, XP, publishing)
- **BracketPool** — multi-user NCAA bracket challenge pool with join code and lock state
- **BracketEntry** — per-user picks (63-game JSON) and computed score/rank
- **BracketGame** — individual game stub with winner tracking; score recomputed on result entry
- **BracketEmailSub** — per-pool Monday email digest subscription
- **BookProfile** — per-user book taste profile (one per user)
- **BookEntry** — liked/disliked books with optional reason text
- **BookRecommendation** — AI-generated book recs with status (WANT/READ/SKIP)
- **BookDigestSub** — weekly new-release email digest subscription
- **UserMemory** — per-user AI-extracted facts by category (`IDENTITY | GOALS | STRENGTHS | CHALLENGES | PROJECTS | WRITING_STYLE | PERSONAL`); source tracked (`extracted` vs `manual`)
- **UserInterest** — interest tags extracted during enrichment; `source` field tracks origin; `accepted` bool for user-removed tags
- **StudentNote** — freeform notes attached to a course; source tracked (`sandy` | `manual`)
- **ArticulationRequest** — AI-evaluated transfer credit request; similarity score (0–100), recommendation (APPROVE/NEEDS_REVIEW/DENY), and admin decision (PENDING/APPROVED/DENIED)
- **ArticulationRoutingRule** — per-department routing thresholds (`autoApproveThreshold`, `autoRouteThreshold`)
- **AdminAnnouncement** — platform-wide banners shown via `PlatformAnnouncementBanner.tsx`; time-bounded via `startsAt`/`endsAt`
- **AdminAuditLog** — log of admin actions (approve/reject/suspend/etc.) with `metadata` JSON
- **SandcastleSubmission** — community tool submissions with AI pre-screening verdict and flags
- **LearningObjective** — per-course learning objectives; linked to source `CourseMaterial`; `moduleNumber` and `orderIndex`
- **StudentObjectiveProgress** — per-student mastery state: `attempts`, `correct`, `masteryLevel` (`not_started | struggling | mastered`), `flaggedForReview`
- **CourseEnrollment** — explicit enrollment record (studentId + courseId)
- **MaterialReadStatus** — tracks which students have read which materials
- **CourseToolLink** — many-to-many join: `syllabusContext`, `weekLabel`, `displayOrder`
- **DocumentChunk** — RAG: one record per ~512-token chunk of a `CourseMaterial`; `embedding` column uses pgvector (Azure AI Search replaces this on migration); `chunkIndex`, `tokenCount`, `courseId` denormalized for fast retrieval
- **PlatformQuest** / **UserPlatformQuest** — platform-wide quests (different from per-tool Quests); types: `COMPLETE_ANY_SESSION | SCORE_ABOVE_THRESHOLD | HIGH_SCORE_N_TOOLS | LEAVE_COMMENT | LAUNCH_MARKETPLACE_TOOL | COMPLETE_COURSE_TOOL`
- **LeaderboardEntry** — generic ranked entry attached to a tool; `score`, `metricKey`, `courseId`
- **Challenge** — per-tool challenge: `challengerScore`, `challengedScore`, `status` (PENDING/ACCEPTED/COMPLETED/EXPIRED), `expiresAt`
- **DiscussionThread** / **DiscussionPost** — threaded course discussion boards; threads can be pinned/locked
- **PortfolioItem** — student portfolio; types: `EDUCATION | EXPERIENCE | PROJECT | PUBLICATION | CERTIFICATION | SKILL | AWARD`; `isVerified` (true if generated from Sandbox activity); `metadata` JSON for AI-extracted tool stats
- **Notification** — in-app notifications; types: `COMMENT_ON_TOOL | COMMENT_REPLY`
- **CollabSession** / **CollabParticipant** / **CollabMessage** — real-time collaborative sessions; modes: `CO_PRESENCE | TURN_BASED | ARTIFACT_BUILDER | COLLABORATIVE_QUEST`; `teamScore`, `artifactContent`, turn tracking
- **PlaygroundApp** — a saved Playground HTML app; `htmlContent`, `publishedAt`
- **AppStoreEntry** — key-value store entries for a PlaygroundApp; `bucket`, `type`, `userId` for per-user scoping
- **AppStoreDelegate** — JWT-authenticated delegate that can access a PlaygroundApp's store
- **GamificationConfig** — per-tool gamification settings: `xpPerMessage`, `xpPerSession`, `xpHighGrade`, `collabXpMultiplier` (1.5×), `collabCompletionBonus` (50 XP), `totalSteps`, `stepLabel`
- **ChatMessage** — individual messages per ToolSession; `tokensUsed`, `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`; `flagged`, `flagCategory`, `flagReason` for moderation
- **League** / **LeagueMember** / **LeagueCycle** / **LeagueSubmission** / **LeagueStanding** / **LeagueEmailSub** / **LeagueEvent** — full competitive league system; kinds: `PREDICTION_MARKET | SURVIVOR_POOL | COFFEE_ROULETTE | WEEKLY_TRIVIA | PITCH_COMPETITION | MEETING_BINGO | SECRET_SANTA | FANTASY_TRADING`
- **NewsSource** / **NewsArticle** — News Hub RSS ingestion with AI summaries, sentiment scoring (`POSITIVE | NEUTRAL | NEGATIVE`), and tagging; `sourceType` (`INTERNAL | EXTERNAL`)

### Not Yet Built (schema absent)
- **StudentAssessment** — AI-generated assessment of a student session against a rubric
- **LearningSignal** — structured output from AI analysis of conversation transcripts
- **KnowledgeBase** — uploaded documents, transcripts, slides that power a faculty avatar tool (RAG infrastructure exists in `lib/` but no dedicated model or UI)

### Gradebook Models (built — live in schema)
- **GradebookEntry** — one entry per student per assignment. Fields: `status` (AI_DRAFT → PENDING_REVIEW → FACULTY_REVIEWING → APPROVED → RELEASED | NEEDS_REVISION), `aiScore`, `aiRawFeedback`, `aiCriteriaScores` (JSON), `facultyScore`, `facultyFeedback`, `facultyCriteriaScores` (JSON)
- **Rubric** — per-assignment rubric with title and ordered `RubricCriterion[]`
- **RubricCriterion** — rubric criterion with `maxPoints`, `description`, and `RubricBand[]`
- **RubricBand** — rubric performance band with `label`, `minPoints`, `maxPoints`, `description`; clicking a band in the grading panel applies its `maxPoints` to that criterion
- **Submission** — student work: `type` (LEGACY_SUBMISSION | AI_EXPERIENCE), `textContent`, `fileUrl`, `sessionId`; linked to a `ToolSession` for AI Experience submissions

