**Status lifecycle (faculty-visible labels):**
| Status | Label shown |
|---|---|
| `AI_DRAFT` | AI Scoring in Progress |
| `PENDING_REVIEW` | Needs Review |
| `FACULTY_REVIEWING` | In Review |
| `APPROVED` | Approved (internal — collapsed into release flow) |
| `RELEASED` | Returned to Student |
| `NEEDS_REVISION` | Revision Requested |

